                                "sense_id": "3a9ed4f8-c72b-3991-a115-79d1e6d9317e",
                                "text": "There is a very general unconformity and break between the Lower and Upper Cretaceous; this has led Chamberlin and Salisbury to suggest that the Lower Cretaceous should be regarded as a separate period with the title \"Comanchean.\""
                            }
                        ]
